    "description": "Estate Smoking Pipe Collection With Wooden Display Stand\nLot of 6 Briar Wood Tobacco Pipes\nMid-to-Late 20th Century\nThis vintage estate collection features six classic smoking pipes crafted primarily from briar wood, accompanied by a traditional two-tiered wooden pipe rack. The rack includes designated slots for pipe storage alongside a recessed circular tray intended for a tobacco jar or humidor. Representing popular mid-century bowl shapes including billiard and Dublin variations, this ensemble reflects the mid-to-late 20th-century era of traditional pipe smoking culture.\nLot includes six estate tobacco pipes and one wooden pipe display rack\nFive smooth briar wood pipes and one dark rusticated carved finish pipe\nClassic vulcanite stems with various shapes and profile inlays\nSolid wood stand features multi-pipe capacity with an integrated round accessory basin\nCondition:\nPre-owned estate condition. Bowls exhibit interior carbon cake buildup, rim darkening, and surface finish wear consistent with age and use. Stems show heavy oxidation, discoloration, and visible tooth chatter or bite wear. One pipe shank features a visible split along the mortise. Wooden rack displays surface scratches, scuffs, and finish wear, particularly within the round base cutout.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
